SITE name="Oak & Steel" nav="Work,Process,Contact" location="Hebden Bridge" contact="studio@oaksteel.co"
THEME family=editorial accent=#8c705e mode=light density=tight
SECTION  id=s1  kind=hero  layout=split  tone=quiet
TEXT sec=s1 slot=eyebrow text="Oak and steel"
TEXT sec=s1 slot=title text="Hand-crafted [commissioned] furniture for your home."
TEXT sec=s1 slot=lede text="We build single pieces in Hebden Bridge, taking ten weeks from initial drawing to final delivery. Each item is made by hand using solid oak frames and polished steel joints."
ACTION sec=s1 slot=primary label="Start a commission" href="#contact"
ACTION sec=s1 slot=secondary label="View past work" href="#portfolio"
MEDIA sec=s1 slot=figure motif=lattice
SECTION  id=s2  kind=detail  layout=split  tone=quiet
TEXT sec=s2 slot=eyebrow text="The single-source advantage"
TEXT sec=s2 slot=title text="We forge our own steel joints in the on-site workshop."
TEXT sec=s2 slot=lede text="Competitors buy pre-fabricated connectors from suppliers, but we cut and bend every bar ourselves right here. This means no shipping delays for custom angles or waiting weeks for off-the-shelf fittings that don't quite match your wall. The steel is forged to the exact curvature of each oak frame before it ever touches a joint."
ACTION sec=s2 slot=primary label="Request a quote" href="#contact"
MEDIA sec=s2 slot=figure motif=strata
SECTION  id=s3  kind=cta  layout=stack  tone=quiet
TEXT sec=s3 slot=title text="Lead time is ten weeks; delivery happens on completion."
TEXT sec=s3 slot=lede text="We accept one commission at a time, so the first step after your drawing is approved is cutting the steel and milling the oak in our Hebden Bridge workshop."
ACTION sec=s3 slot=primary label="Begin your project" href="#contact"
